# ===========================================================================
# EV-Simulation — files that must never be committed.
# Sections run from most to least dangerous to leak.
# ===========================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets & environment
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY bypasses RLS on the shared CRM project, so every
# env-file variant is ignored. Only the placeholder template is tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
.envrc
.dev.vars
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*-credentials.json
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.netrc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI assistants / coding agents — local instructions, memory, settings, caches
# (`next dev` rewrites AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md on every start, too).
# The wildcard rows at the end of each group catch tools not listed yet.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
